==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|la|quiēscō|}} ("I rest, repose, become quiet").

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/kwiˈɛs/|/kwaɪˈɛs/|a=UK}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-quiesce.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To become [[quiet]] or quieter.
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To make temporarily [[inactive]] or [[disabled]].
# {{lb|en|computing|transitive}} To [[pause]] or reduce the [[activity]] of (a device or application), for example to prepare it for [[backup]]s or other maintenance.

